","url":"/docs/ui#which-ambriel-product-do-you-need","content":"A shared fraud and AML workspace with escalations built in"},"54":{"id":"/docs/ui-29","page_id":"/docs/ui","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui#how-do-you-stop-transactional-fraud","content":"Ambriel's primary fraud prevention tool is the Fraud API, a versatile and modular API that consolidates digital footprinting, decisioning, and risk scoring capabilities into a single, streamlined response. This unified structure allows businesses to submit data inputs and receive enriched insights, rule evaluations, and risk scores in real-time, enabling effective security strategies."},"55":{"id":"/docs/ui-30","page_id":"/docs/ui","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui#how-do-you-verify-who-is-behind-the-screen","content":"Ambriel's Digital Footprint capabilities provide critical data for fraud prevention by revealing patterns of online behavior, identifying suspicious activity, and verifying the authenticity of user profiles. The Email API, Phone API, and IP API offer rich insights into linked profiles, data breaches, and the reputation of contact details. These tools help detect fraudulent behaviors early, such as disposable emails, suspicious IP addresses, and potentially compromised phone numbers.\nRead more."},"56":{"id":"/docs/ui-31","page_id":"/docs/ui","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui#how-do-you-catch-device-spoofing-and-bots","content":"The Device Intelligence suite, available through Ambriel's Device Fingerprinting SDKs and the Fraud API, enables businesses to track device attributes, behavioral biometrics, and patterns of interaction. By collecting data on device configurations, browser settings, and user behaviors, Ambriel helps detect bot activity, device spoofing, and multi-accounting attempts. This proactive layer of protection supports both real-time threat detection and ongoing monitoring.\nRead more."},"57":{"id":"/docs/ui-32","page_id":"/docs/ui","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui#how-do-you-meet-aml-obligations","content":"Ambriel offers a suite of Anti-Money Laundering (AML) compliance tools designed to simplify regulatory adherence while enhancing fraud detection capabilities. These tools integrate seamlessly with the Fraud API, providing a holistic approach to financial crime prevention."},"58":{"id":"/docs/ui-33","page_id":"/docs/ui","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui#how-do-you-meet-aml-obligations","content":"Ambriel's AML tools are designed to be compatible with the Anti-Money Laundering Directive (AMLD5/6) of the European Union, as well as the recommendations of the Financial Action Task Force (FATF).\nRead more."},"59":{"id":"/docs/ui-34","page_id":"/docs/ui","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui#how-do-you-vet-business-customers","content":"Ambriel's Know Your Business (KYB) solution enables organizations to assess and verify the legitimacy of business entities they engage with. By analyzing company registration data, ownership structures, and corporate relationships, the KYB API helps identify shell companies, beneficial owners, and potential money laundering risks. This comprehensive risk assessment supports due diligence requirements and ensures compliance with regulatory standards."},"60":{"id":"/docs/ui-35","page_id":"/docs/ui","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui#how-do-you-vet-business-customers","content":"Ambriel's KYB tools are designed to be compatible with the Anti-Money Laundering Directive (AMLD5/6) of the European Union, as well as the recommendations of the Financial Action Task Force (FATF).\nRead more."},"61":{"id":"/docs/ui-36","page_id":"/docs/ui","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui#how-do-you-screen-and-monitor-customers","content":"The AML API and Fraud API collaborate to screen customers against global sanction lists, PEP (Politically Exposed Persons) databases, and high-risk profiles. This solution supports continuous monitoring, alerting businesses to any changes in a customer’s compliance status over time."},"62":{"id":"/docs/ui-37","page_id":"/docs/ui","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui#how-do-you-investigate-and-report","content":"Ambriel’s Case Management platform provides a centralized hub for managing fraud investigations and regulatory reporting. By unifying fraud and AML data into a shared workspace, businesses can streamline manual processes, reduce investigation times, and improve operational efficiency. The platform includes tools for documenting findings, managing escalations, and ensuring audit readiness."},"63":{"id":"/docs/ui-38","page_id":"/docs/ui","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui#how-do-you-investigate-and-report","content":"Pick one integration path in Getting Started — REST API, JavaScript agent, or an e-commerce plugin — then switch on the products from the table above one at a time."},"64":{"id":"/docs/ui/test","page_id":"/docs/ui/test","type":"page","content":"Components","url":"/docs/ui/test"},"65":{"id":"/docs/ui/test-0","page_id":"/docs/ui/test","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/test","content":"Components"},"66":{"id":"/docs/ui/test-1","page_id":"/docs/ui/test","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/test#grid","content":"Grid"},"67":{"id":"/docs/ui/test-2","page_id":"/docs/ui/test","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/test#accordion","content":"Accordion"},"68":{"id":"/docs/ui/test-3","page_id":"/docs/ui/test","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/test#steps","content":"Steps"},"69":{"id":"/docs/ui/test-4","page_id":"/docs/ui/test","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/test#tabs","content":"Tabs"},"70":{"id":"/docs/ui/test-5","page_id":"/docs/ui/test","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/test#code-block","content":"Code Block"},"71":{"id":"/docs/ui/test-6","page_id":"/docs/ui/test","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/test#cards","content":"Cards"},"72":{"id":"/docs/ui/test-7","page_id":"/docs/ui/test","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/test","content":"you are documentation engineer, use fumadoc, use mdx, use fumadoc components. rewrite this documentation, make it more clear for end user. dont use same sencentes."},"73":{"id":"/docs/ui/test-8","page_id":"/docs/ui/test","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/test","content":"The growth of the Internet and its usage leaves a trace of simple, easily accessible information about almost every internet user – a trace that we label “digital footprints”"},"74":{"id":"/docs/ui/test-9","page_id":"/docs/ui/test","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/test","content":"Digital footprints are also left behind when people are registering, accessing or using your digital products. Trustfull is a cloud-based platform that analyses the information content of such digital footprints, to almost instantaneously evaluate the quality and reliability of your online customers."},"75":{"id":"/docs/ui/test-10","page_id":"/docs/ui/test","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/test","content":"Our platform examines hundreds of digital footprints arising from user's\nPhone Number, Email Address, IP Address, Device, and Browser Data\nInformation about these digital signals can be retrieved separately or combined together to understand the combined score of the compiled Onboarding Solution"},"76":{"id":"/docs/ui/test-11","page_id":"/docs/ui/test","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/test#accordion","content":"Based on\nRadix UI Accordion, useful for FAQ\nsections."},"77":{"id":"/docs/ui/test-12","page_id":"/docs/ui/test","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/test#accordion","content":"Code:"},"78":{"id":"/docs/ui/test-13","page_id":"/docs/ui/test","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/test#steps","content":"Login to dashboard"},"79":{"id":"/docs/ui/test-14","page_id":"/docs/ui/test","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/test#steps","content":"Go to Aml > Entities"},"80":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"page","content":"ChatGPT","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt"},"81":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-0","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","content":"Connect Ambriel to ChatGPT via MCP: query fraud scores, run AML screens and investigate alerts conversationally inside chat."},"82":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-1","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#chatgpt","content":"ChatGPT"},"83":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-2","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#setup","content":"Setup"},"84":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-3","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"Which tools are exposed?"},"85":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-4","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#example","content":"Example"},"86":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-5","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#faq","content":"FAQ"},"87":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-6","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#next-steps","content":"Next steps"},"88":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-7","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#chatgpt","content":"You can connect Ambriel to ChatGPT via MCP in under five minutes with OAuth, no API keys needed. Once linked, you can query fraud scores, run AML and sanctions screens, enrich emails, phones, and IPs, and investigate alerts conversationally without ever leaving the chat window."},"89":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-8","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#chatgpt","content":"title: Prerequisites"},"90":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-9","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#chatgpt","content":"You need a ChatGPT Plus, Team, or Enterprise plan with connector support, plus an Ambriel account with compliance API access. OAuth handles auth — no API keys to copy."},"91":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-10","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#chatgpt","content":"ChatGPT suits ad-hoc investigations: paste an alert ID, ask for context, and chain follow-ups in plain English. Ambriel's MCP server exposes the same fraud, AML, and lookup tools as the API, so answers are live data — not model guesses. Calls are authenticated as you and scoped to your org's permissions."},"92":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-11","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#setup","content":"Open ChatGPT and create or edit a custom GPT, then go to Configure → Actions (on Team/Enterprise: Settings → Connectors → Add Custom Connector). Register Ambriel there as an external tool."},"93":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-12","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#setup","content":"Click the add button to register a new server endpoint."},"94":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-13","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#setup","content":"Paste the MCP server URL below as the action endpoint; ChatGPT fetches the tools automatically."},"95":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-14","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#setup","content":"Fill the form as given."},"96":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-15","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#setup","content":"Field"},"97":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-16","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#setup","content":"Value"},"98":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-17","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#setup","content":"Name"},"99":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-18","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#setup","content":"Ambriel"},"100":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-19","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#setup","content":"Connection"},"101":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/ch