hone numbers and returns carrier and risk data"},"122":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-41","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"ip-lookup"},"123":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-42","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"Enriches an IP with geolocation, ASN, and proxy/VPN flags"},"124":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-43","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"kyb-evaluate"},"125":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-44","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"Returns a company risk profile for KYB reviews"},"126":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-45","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"bin-lookup"},"127":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-46","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"Resolves card BINs to issuer, scheme, and country"},"128":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-47","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"All tools respect your org's rate limits and audit logging, so conversational access is as governed as direct API calls."},"129":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-48","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#example","content":"Screen, enrich, then decide — all in one thread:"},"130":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-49","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#example","content":"Example prompts that work well:"},"131":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-50","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#example","content":"\"Screen Acme Ltd against AML watchlists and summarize any hits.\""},"132":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-51","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#example","content":"\"This email bounced twice — is it disposable or breached?\""},"133":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-52","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#example","content":"\"Score order #48291 and tell me whether to approve, review, or block.\""},"134":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-53","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#faq","content":"Go back to the connector settings and click Connect again to refresh OAuth. Expiry usually means your Ambriel session was revoked or your password changed. Re-authorizing takes under a minute."},"135":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-54","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#faq","content":"You need Plus, Team, Enterprise, or Edu with custom GPTs or connectors enabled. Free accounts cannot add external MCP servers. If your admin disables third-party connectors, ask them to allowlist mcp.ambriel.io."},"136":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-55","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#faq","content":"Only your prompt fields and the tool response pass through the conversation. Each call is authenticated via OAuth and logged under your identity. Query the minimum fields you need, just as in the dashboard."},"137":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-56","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#faq","content":"Yes. In the custom GPT action settings you can toggle operations off, or restrict the system prompt to tools like aml-screen only. For org-wide control, adjust OAuth scopes in your Ambriel admin settings."},"138":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/claude","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/claude","type":"page","content":"Claude","url":"/docs/ui/agents/claude"},"139"