,"content":"Which tools are exposed?"},"251":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-4","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#example","content":"Example"},"252":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-5","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#faq","content":"FAQ"},"253":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-6","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#next-steps","content":"Next steps"},"254":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-7","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#devin","content":"You can connect Ambriel to Devin AI via MCP with a single config block and OAuth, no API keys needed. Once linked, your autonomous engineer can query fraud scores, run AML screens, and enrich emails, phones, IPs, and BINs while it implements and tests risk workflows on its own."},"255":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-8","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#devin","content":"title: Prerequisites"},"256":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-9","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#devin","content":"You need a Devin workspace with MCP support and permission to edit .devin/config.json, plus an Ambriel account with compliance API access. Keep a browser handy for the first-run OAuth approval that authorizes Devin's tool calls."},"257":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-10","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#devin","content":"Devin suits tasks spanning many steps: scaffolding a screening service, backfilling KYB checks, or adding fraud gates to checkout. With Ambriel tools available, Devin grounds decisions in live risk data and cites real responses in its PR summary."},"258":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-11","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#setup","content":"Devin uses a .devin/config.json configuration file in your project root. Create or edit the file."},"259":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-12","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#setup","content":"Add the following configuration with the URL format:"},"260":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-13","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#setup","content":"Commit the file so every Devin session in that repo inherits the connector. Use a global Devin MCP setting instead if you want Ambriel available across all repositories."},"261":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-14","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#setup","content":"When you first use an Ambriel tool, Devin will open a browser window for OAuth authentication. Sign in with your Ambriel credentials and authorize the connection."},"262":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-15","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#setup","content":"Approve the scopes once. Devin persists the session token, so subsequent tasks reuse it without interrupting the run."},"263":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-16","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#setup","content":"The Ambriel tools are now available to Devin."},"264":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-17","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#setup","content":"Assign a concrete task to verify: \"Add AML screening to the vendor onboarding endpoint, test it with two sample companies, and report the verdicts.\" Watch the session log for aml-screen and kyb-evaluate calls before it opens the PR."},"265":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-18","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#setup","content":"You can configure MCP servers globally or per-session in Devin's settings panel."},"266":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-19","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"Devin sees the full compliance surface and can chain tools across long-running plans without further prompting."},"267":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-20","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"Tool"},"268":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-21","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"What it does"},"269":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-22","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"fraud-score"},"270":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-23","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"Scores transactions Devin creates during testing"},"271":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-24","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"aml-screen"},"272":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-25","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"Screens people and vendors in bulk onboarding jobs"},"273":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-26","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"email-lookup"},"274":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-27","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"Validates test and seed emails for deliverability"},"275":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-28","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"phone-lookup"},"276":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-29","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"Checks phone fixtures for validity and carrier data"},"277":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-30","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"ip-lookup"},"278":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-31","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"Flags proxy or datacenter IPs in abuse-handling code"},"279":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-32","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"kyb-evaluate"},"280":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-33","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"Fetches company risk profiles for review queues"},"281":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-34","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"bin-lookup"},"282":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-35","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"Resolves BINs while building payment validations"},"283":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-36","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"For audits, ask Devin to log every verdict: \"Record each screening result with entity, tool, and timestamp in the PR description.\""},"284":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-37","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#example","content":"Give Devin an outcome, not just a function — for example, backfilling screens for existing merchants or adding a blocklist check with passing tests. It will plan, call Ambriel, iterate, and summarize evidence."},"285":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-38","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#example","content":"Review the session transcript for tool inputs before merging. Devin's autonomy is powerful, but screening thresholds and block decisions should still get human approval."},"286":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-39","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#faq","content":"Use OAuth, not your password: Devin opens an Ambriel authorization page for scoped access. For shared machines, create a dedicated service identity so Devin's calls are attributed separately."},"287":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-40","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#faq","content":"Use .devin/config.json when the whole team needs compliance checks in that codebase, and global config for personal experiments. Repo config wins on conflicts."},"288":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-41","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#faq","content":"Instruct it explicitly: \"Only use synthetic fixtures, never real customer PII, and mock Ambriel in unit tests.\" Reserve live calls for integration sessions with approved test entities."},"289":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin-42","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/devin","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/devin#faq","content":"Yes. Ask for batched kyb-evaluate calls with retries and a CSV summary of verdicts. Start with a small batch to validate match logic, then scale up."},"290":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents","type":"page","content":"AI Agents & MCP","url":"/docs/ui/agents"},"291":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents-0","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents","content":"Connect Ambriel to Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor, Windsurf and more via MCP: query live risk data from your favorite AI assistant."},"292":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents-1","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/agents#what-is-mcp","content":"What is MCP?"},"293":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents-2","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/agents#authentication","content":"Authentication"},"294":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents-3","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/agents#available-agents","content":"Available Agents"},"295":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents-4","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/agents#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"Which tools are exposed?"},"296":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents-5","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/agents#quick-start","content":"Quick Start"},"297":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents-6","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/agents#faq","content":"FAQ"},"298":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents-7","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/agents#next-steps","content":"Next steps"},"299":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents-8","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents","content":"You can connect Ambriel to Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor, Devin, and other assistants via one MCP server at https://mcp.ambriel.io/compliance. Authenticate once with OAuth and your agent can immediately query live fraud scores, AML screens, KYB profiles, and reputation lookups without manual API keys."},"300":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents-9","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents","content":"title: Prerequisites"},"301":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents-10","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents","content":"You need an Ambriel account with compliance API access and an MCP-capable client (Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor, Devin, or Windsurf). Setup clicks differ; the server URL is the same."},"302":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents-11","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents","content":"Ambriel's MCP server lets agents call the API directly — fraud scores, entity screens, email/phone/IP checks, and KYB evaluations from inside your AI tool."},"303":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents-12","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents#what-is-mcp","content":"The Model Context Protocol (MCP) is an open standard that connects AI models with external tools and data sources. Ambriel's MCP server acts as a bridge, giving your AI agent access to the full Ambriel API surface."},"304":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents-13","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents#what-is-mcp","content":"Instead of copying data between dashboard and assistant, the model calls Ambriel tools mid-conversation and reasons over fresh JSON. You get grounded answers — \"this IP is a datacenter proxy\" — rather than guesses from training data."},"305":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents-14","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents#authentication","content":"Ambriel's MCP server uses OAuth for authentication. When you first connect, your agent opens a browser window for Ambriel login and authorization. No manual API key management is needed."},"306":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents-15","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents#authentication","content":"Tokens are scoped to your user and org, so agents inherit exactly your permissions. Revoking access in Ambriel disconnects every agent session at once."},"307":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents-16","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents#available-agents","content":"Claude and ChatGPT suit investigations; Cursor and Devin suit builders wiring screening into code."},"308":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents-17","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"Every agent gets the same governed compliance toolset through the single MCP endpoint. The model selects tools from your wording, or you can name one explicitly."},"309":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents-18","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"Tool"},"310":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents-19","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"What it does"},"311":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents-20","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"fraud-score"},"312":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents-21","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"Scores transactions and customers with risk reasons"},"313":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents-22","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"aml-screen"},"314":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents-23","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"Screens people and companies against sanctions and PEP lists"},"315":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents-24","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"email-lookup"},"316":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents-25","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"Checks email validity, deliverability, and breach history"},"317":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents-26","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"phone-lookup"},"318":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents-27","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"Validates phones with carrier and reachability signals"},"319":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents-28","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"ip-lookup"},"320":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents-29","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"Enriches IPs with geo, ASN, and proxy/VPN detection"},"321":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents-30","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"kyb-evaluate"},"322":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents-31","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"Builds company risk profiles for KYB reviews"},"323":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents-32","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents#which-tools-are-exposed","content":"bin-lookup"},"324":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents-33","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents","type":"t