uates a specific risk factor and has three components:"},"1194":{"id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies-38","page_id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies#how-rules-work","content":"Impact: How severe would this risk be if it materialized? (1 = Minor issue, 5 = Critical threat)"},"1195":{"id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies-39","page_id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies#how-rules-work","content":"Likelihood: How probable is this risk in practice? (1 = Rare, 5 = Very common)"},"1196":{"id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies-40","page_id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies#how-rules-work","content":"Weight: How important is this rule category to your business? (typically 1, but adjustable)"},"1197":{"id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies-41","page_id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies#how-rules-work","content":"When a rule triggers, its score is calculated as:"},"1198":{"id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies-42","page_id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies#risk-matrix-reference","content":"This 5×5 matrix shows how Impact and Likelihood combine into risk classifications:"},"1199":{"id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies-43","page_id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies#risk-matrix-reference","content":"Impact \\ Likelihood"},"1200":{"id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies-44","page_id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies#risk-matrix-reference","content":"Very Low (1)"},"1201":{"id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies-45","page_id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies#risk-matrix-reference","content":"Low (2)"},"1202":{"id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies-46","page_id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies#risk-matrix-reference","content":"Medium (3)"},"1203":{"id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies-47","page_id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies","type":"