cts/ip-address-data#what-does-the-api-return","content":"Company operating the block (e.g. a hosting provider)"},"1549":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data-29","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data#what-does-the-api-return","content":"Datacenter ASNs on a \"residential\" signup deserve review"},"1550":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data-30","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data#try-it-example-request","content":"type: warning"},"1551":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data-31","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data#try-it-example-request","content":"title: Never block on geolocation alone"},"1552":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data-32","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data#try-it-example-request","content":"IP geolocation is indicative, not exact — corporate VPNs and mobile carriers routinely place users in a neighboring city. Combine location with VPN, blacklist, and ASN signals before declining."},"1553":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data-33","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data#how-to-interpret-ip-address-data-results","content":"VPN use alone is common and often legitimate, especially for remote workers. Allow routine actions, but require step-up authentication for payouts, password changes, or jurisdiction-restricted content while the VPN flag is set."},"1554":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data-34","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data#how-to-interpret-ip-address-data-results","content":"Datacenter ASNs frequently back bots, emulators, and multi-account farms, but they also back corporate offices. Correlate with Device Detection: a datacenter ASN plus an emulator flag is a strong automation signal."},"1555":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data-35","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/products/ip-address-data#how-to-interpret-ip-address-data-results","content":"Treat blacklist hits as corroboration, not verdicts — listings lag and shared IPs inherit history. Block only when the hit aligns with your policy's lists and the session shows other risk; otherwise route to review with the evidence attached."},"1556":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/phone-number-intelligence","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/phone-number-intelligence","type":"page","content":"Phone Number Intelligence","url":"/docs/ui/products/phone-number-intelligence"},"1557":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/phone-number-intelligence-0","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/phone-number-intelligence","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/products/phone-number-intelligence","content":"Gain actionable intelligence on phone numbers globally to strengthen authentications, evaluate fraud risks, and enhance user experience."},"1558":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/phone-number-intelligence-1","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/phone-number-intelligence","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/products/phone-number-intelligence#what-is-phone-number-intelligence","content":"What is Phone Number Intelligence?"},"1559":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/phone-number-intelligence-2","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/phone-number-intelligence","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/products/phone-number-intelligence#key-features","content":"Key Features"},"1560":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/phone-number-intelligence-3","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/phone-number-intelligence","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/products/phone-number-intelligence#how-can-you-use-phone-number-intelligence","content":"How can you use Phone Number Intelligence?"},"1561":{"id":"/docs/ui/products/phone-number-intelligence-4","page_id":"/docs/ui/products/phone-number-intelligence","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/products/phone-number-intell